cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Wordflow in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Wordflow"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Guo"
    given-names: "Senhui"
    alias: "Alex"
  - family-names: "Sun"
    given-names: "Chao"
abstract: >-
  Wordflow (by LDaCA) is open-source, point-and-click text analytics from the
  Language Data Commons of Australia. Load your text, then explore it with
  Frequency, Concordance, Trends, Topics, Quotation and Annotation. Each result
  becomes a Data Block in the Project Graph, so the steps of an analysis stay
  visible.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.20408328"
identifiers:
